           _5             The IPv4 or IPv6 address of the foreign host, in dot‐
                         ted quad (IPv4 packet) or colon-separated hex (IPv6
                         packet) notation.

           _6             The TCP port that the foreign host is communicating
                         via.

           _7             The slow start threshold for the flow, in bytes.

           _8             The current congestion window for the flow, in bytes.

           _9             The current state of the t_flags2 field for the flow.

           _1_0            The current sending window for the flow, in bytes.
                         The post scaled value is reported.

           _1_1            The current receive window for the flow, in bytes.
                         The post scaled value is always reported.

