           _1_7            SACK enabled indicator. 1 if SACK enabled, 0 other‐
                         wise.

           _1_8            The current state of the TCP flags for the flow.  See
                         ⟨_n_e_t_i_n_e_t_/_t_c_p___v_a_r_._h⟩ for information about the various
